<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113564" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρᾰγωγ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lead by the hand,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				16.26
			</span></i> cod. A, <i><span class="en">
				Muson.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				15
			</span></i>A<i><span class="en">
				p.79H.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				9.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cleom.</u>
				38
			</span></i>: generally, <i>guide, direct,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρυκτώρια ἐς ἀσφαλεῖς καταγωγὰς τὰς
					ναῦς χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					4.2.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τούτῳ τὴν ἔξοδον</span>
			will <i>guide</i> his exit, Procop.Gaz.<i><span class="en">
				p.158B.
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τὴν εὕρεσιν μνήμῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.48b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ψυχὴν ἐπί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.
				</span></i>
			 Tyr.<i><span class="en">
				10.6
			</span></i>; also <i>'lead by the nose', cajole,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Posidon.
				36J.
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Chr.</u>
				30
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>To.</u>
				11.16
			</span></i> cod. &lt;*&gt;, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ αὐτῶν τῶν πραγμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					3p.22
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				13.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					7.1.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
